// Windows resource script — gives netpanzer-editor.exe its icon in Explorer,
// the taskbar and the Start Menu shortcut.
//
// The ID is the literal 1, not a symbolic name like IDI_ICON1: without
// including windows.h that symbol is undefined, and both rc.exe and windres
// would then emit a *named* resource. Windows picks an executable's icon by
// lowest numeric ID, so a named resource may not be used at all.
1 ICON "netpanzer-editor.ico"
